 the comments are inconsistent (not for every value) and some of them are likely outdated. Also they pretty much duplicate what is already said in the documentation. You can say that it's QoL for people with IDE that shows them these comments on hover, but does anyone actually rely on that?\r\n\r\nHowever the worst part of these comments is that they are located in `object.h`, one of the most core files included everywhere. I've had it enough with testing editor pull requests that caused rebuilding of the whole engine because of some useless comment change.\r\n\r\nAside from removing the comments, I also wrapped deprecated values in `DISABLE_DEPRECATED` and added a comment for unused spot in PropertyUsageFlags.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}